; Development-only profile: a random legal-move picker, so a fixture can produce a
; game the player wins. The shipped heuristic at its weakest still beat the autoplay
; brain by half a point, and every engine profile beat it by forty (ENG-06). The
; review reads any finished game, so a won game's cards need no engine opposite.
